OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly morning for many with
OL,6,Fsome frost and patches of mist and fog
OL,7,Fin some spots. Any fog should clear
OL,8,Fthrough the morning to leave a bright
OL,9,Fand sunny day with some patchy cloud
OL,10,Fthrough the afternoon. Feeling fresh.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPlenty of evening sunshine on
OL,13,Foffer leading to a fairly clear night
OL,14,Finitially. Turning cloudier from the
OL,15,Fsoutheast through the early hours,
OL,16,Fwith a few showers possible by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
