OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FSome early brightness in the
OL,6,Fnorth, but cloud thickening to bring
OL,7,Fshowery rain to most areas during the
OL,8,Fmorning. Rain petering out in the
OL,9,Fafternoon, with some brighter spells
OL,10,Freturning.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FUnsettled through Tuesday and
OL,14,FWednesday with cloudy skies, patchy
OL,15,Frain and brisk winds at times,
OL,16,Fespecially around coasts. Brighter
OL,17,Fspells on Thursday, but with showers
OL,18,Fstill likely. Perhaps windy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
